      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA8D774F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B36839672C5C314E0D662F000A5BC6963F96F776844EBA54273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是來旅行的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
