      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "712153EF5949544A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就說吧。\n發音聽起來就不是密阿雷腔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
