      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "年輕人……\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳真是極度不願意配合呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E748F154EBA20262026000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3771F662F69755EA64E0D9858610F914D540854623002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一開始就這樣乖乖的，\n不就好了嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E00958B59CB5C3190196A234E564E567684FF0C000A4E0D5C31597D4E86561B3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "黏黏寶！\n不可以自己跑到這麼遠來啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9ECF9ECF5BF6FF01000A4E0D53EF4EE581EA5DF18DD1523090199EBC90604F86554A300200100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "黏噢～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9ECF5662FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "長椅都被你弄髒了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9577690590FD88AB4F605F049AD24E862026202600100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來！黏黏寶，\n我把長椅弄乾淨了。我們回去吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F86FF019ECF9ECF5BF6FF0C000A6211628A957769055F044E7E6DE84E8630026211501156DE53BB5427300200100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來那不是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的黏黏寶啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8690A34E0D662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B376849ECF9ECF5BF6554A3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟密阿雷市裡四處都\n多了不少野生寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了預防麻煩事發生，\n我們免不了得多問些問題，抱歉了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF5BC6963F96F75E0288E156DB865590FD000A591A4E864E0D5C1191CE751F5BF653EF5922300200100001BE01000A70BA4E86981096329EBB71694E8B767C751FFF0C000A62115011514D4E0D4E865F97591A554F4E9B554F984CFF0C62B16B494E863002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就當作是道歉，\n我告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一件好事情吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要讓黏黏寶進化成最強樣子的條件，\n似乎和下雨有關喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3175764F5C662F90536B49FF0C000A6211544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B34E004EF6597D4E8B60C55427300200100001BE01000A89818B939ECF9ECF5BF690325316621067005F376A235B507684689D4EF6FF0C000A4F3C4E4E548C4E0B96E8670995DC55943002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳配合盤查！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
